msgstr "400 字节"

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Not every action type exists at every version. V3 has only `ScriptTransfer` and a single `DataEntry` type, returned in a `TransferSet`, a `WriteSet` or both in a `ScriptResult`. `Issue`, `Reissue`, `Burn`, `SponsorFee` and the typed data entries arrive in V4, and `Lease` and `LeaseCancel` in V5. See {doc}`Previous Versions <11_previous-versions>`."
msgstr "并不是每个版本都存在每个动作类型.V3只有 `ScriptTransfer` 和单个 `DataEntry` 型,以 `TransferSet` 回放,以 `WriteSet` 回放或两者并用为 `ScriptResult`. `Issue`, `Reissue`, `Burn`, `SponsorFee` 和打出的数据分录到达V4,而 `Lease` 和 `LeaseCancel` 到达V5.见 {doc}`上一个版本 <11_previous-versions>`."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:53
msgid "How the action limits are counted:"
msgstr "动作限制如何计算:"

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:55
msgid "**Across the whole invocation.** The action counts are totals for every callable an invocation runs, including those reached through dApp-to-dApp calls."
msgstr "**整个引用。** 每一个可调用的引用运行,包括通过dApp至dApp呼叫达到的引用运行,动作计数为总计."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:56
msgid "**By the outermost dApp's version, from feature 19.** Once feature 19 is active, a chain of dApp-to-dApp calls is held to the limits of the version of the dApp the transaction invoked. Before that, each dApp's own version applied."
msgstr "**由最外侧的dApp版本出自第19个特征.** 一旦特性19被激活,一个dApp至dApp的连锁呼叫被扣到交易所引用的dApp版本的极限.在此之前,每个dApp自己的版本都适用."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:57
msgid "**Data size.** One callable's data entries can store at most 5 KB (5,120 bytes), and all callables in one invocation together at most 15 KB (15,360 bytes). From feature 17, this size is the key's UTF-8 bytes plus the value's bytes (8 for an integer, 1 for a boolean, nothing for a delete). Before that, it was each entry's serialized size."
msgstr "**数据大小.** 一个可调用的数据条目最多可以存储5个KB(5,120字节),所有可调用数据最多一起存储15个KB(15,360字节).从特征17,这个大小是键的UTF-8字节加上值的字节(整数为8个,布尔为1个,删除为无).在此之前,这是每个条目的序列大小."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:58
msgid "**Total payments, from feature 17.** Once feature 17 is active, an invocation and every dApp-to-dApp call it makes can attach at most 100 payments together."
msgstr "**总付款额,从第17项。** 一旦特性17活动,一个引用和它每次发出的dApp到dApp呼叫最多可附加100个付款."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:59
msgid "**Empty keys.** From version 4, a data entry key cannot be empty."
msgstr "**空密钥.** 从第4版开始,数据条目密钥不能为空."

#: ../../03_ride-language/10_limitations.md:61
msgid "The Invoke Script transaction that starts an invocation can be at most 5 KB (5,120 bytes)."
msgstr "启动引用的Invoke脚本交易最多可达5 KB (5,120字节)."

